      "contentType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
      "textPreview": "Backyard Breaks x ClipHouse Account Creation Guide How to set up Backyard Breaks clip pages before posting. Start Here If you already have a Backyard Breaks clip/highlight account, use that account first. Do not create a new account unless you need one. 1. Account Requirement &bull; Use a dedicated Backyard Breaks clip page. Do not post campaign submissions from your personal account. &bull; The account should look like a clean Backyard Breaks highlights/fan page, not a random repost account. &bull; If your existing Backyard Breaks account has posting history and looks clean, use it. &bull; New accounts should be set up fully before the first post: handle, profile photo, bio, and link. 2. Username / Naming Conventions Naming Goal The name should clearly tell viewers this page is for Backyard Breaks clips, pulls, highlights, or moments. Preferred Format Examples backyardbreaks_[word] backyardbreaks_pulls / backyardbreaks_moments / backyardbreaks_hits backyardbreaks[modifier] backyardbreaksclips / backyardbreakshighlights / backyardbreaksreels bbreaks_[word] bbreaks_pulls / bbreaks_hits / bbreaks_moments backyard_[word] backyard_pulls / backyard_hits / backyard_moments Do Not Use &bu"
