      "textPreview": "Backyard Breaks x ClipHouse Clipper Brand & Niche Guide Everything you need to understand this brand, this niche, and what makes a moment worth clipping. 1. What Is Backyard Breaks Backyard Breaks is one of the largest sports card breaking brands in the world. They stream live pack openings on Whatnot, TikTok, Instagram Live, and Twitch &mdash; up to seven days a week &mdash; where viewers pay to participate in breaks and watch rare cards get pulled in real time. They have 30+ professional breakers on staff and have built an audience of nearly 800,000 on TikTok alone. The brand positions itself as the best breaking show on earth &mdash; high energy, big personalities, huge pulls. Your job as a clipper is to take the best moments from their streams and turn them into short-form content that pulls new audiences into the brand. You are their growth engine on TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts. 2. What Is a Card Break A card break is a group buy. Instead of one person spending $3,000 on a box of sports cards, a group of people each pay a smaller amount to participate. The host opens the cards live on stream, and whoever bought the corresponding team or slot gets the cards pull"
